{"seq":1,"slug":"the-american-archetype","title":"美国精神的原型","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/benjamin-franklin/influence-and-legacy/the-american-archetype","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-self-made-man","title":"白手起家的典范","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/benjamin-franklin/influence-and-legacy/the-american-archetype/the-self-made-man","wordCount":1701,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-first-american","title":"第一个美国人","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/benjamin-franklin/influence-and-legacy/the-american-archetype/the-first-american","wordCount":1680,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"美国精神的原型\">美国精神的原型</h1><p>本章论述本杰明·富兰克林作为&quot;美国精神原型&quot;的崇高地位。富兰克林从寒微之子凭借自身奋斗成长为一代伟人，是&quot;白手起家&quot;美国精神最初的、最生动的典范，也是&quot;美国梦&quot;最初的象征。他集中体现的勤勉、务实、自立、进取、崇尚理性、热心公益的品格，使他被誉为&quot;第一个美国人&quot;——定义&quot;美国人&quot;这一身份的标志性人物。本章呈现的，是富兰克林作为美国民族精神化身与象征的深远意义。</p>\n"}